  "description": "What: a man-portable flamethrower burns what its jet reaches and nothing else (CE-4635 FL-1, R-3111; docs/designs/weapons/DESIGN_Flame_Weapons.md \u00a77). On basic-desert 'Flamer' (a FlamethrowerSoldier, friend, ordered FireAtTarget) fires east at 'Target', an unarmed hostile holding 20 m away. Behind the target on the same line stands an empty civilian 'Car' (30 m) and behind the car 'Hidden' (36 m); 'Aside' stands 12 m off the line. Judge: no round flies \u2014 the flamer's fuel falls; the Target is set alight (EffectState.BurningUntil) after ~0.3 s of flame, burns and dies; the Car inside the cone catches fire (FireState) after ~1.5 s of it; 'Hidden' never burns (the car's body stops the flame); 'Aside' never burns (outside the 6\u00b0 cone)."
 },
